u that the situation is normal. It's like a headache pill - it never removes the cause, but only hides it. In the newspapers, you'll read stories of victories, promises of future salvation, and a bit of advertising for the &quot;right&quot; products. But having learned to understand the hints of clerical language, you will see the real picture of what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618660/extras/e5c6e39a37ca28136830e170519ef346.avif?t=1769782353\" width=1170 height=462 /></span></p>","developers":["Gamet"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618660/9533c748cf8140a47a29d21a264891e165652f15/header.jpg?t=1769782353","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3618660/879514/707d9886d5e5207467992d1f09dbf567fd90b5a5/1750454094/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746009603","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3618660/879514/707d9886d5e5207467992d1f09dbf567fd90b5a5/1750454094/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746009603","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3618660/879514/707d9886d5e5207467992d1f09dbf567fd90b5a5/1750454094/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746009603","id":257131866,"name":"Antidote to despair trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131866/cbe3c461ac84170c8ea470c82189608ba4003b28/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746009603"}],"name":"Antidote to despair","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics with 